  m_text: "Ragana Vilkaite was born in Ukmerg\xE9, Lithuania. Her childhood consisted
    of petty thefts and everything she considered fun, the thing she values more
    than anything else in life. Ragana always tries to approach other beings in a
    friendly manner which often ends up giving her the same treatment. \r\n\r\nSpecial
    effects:\r\no\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
