  m_text: "Lars-G\xF6ran is a very competitive individual from Dalarna, Sweden. He
    was a soldier during the war, which he bears heavy scars from. Lars-G\xF6ran
    frequently tries to distract his opponents by calling them names or telling dark
    jokes during the race.\n\nSpecial effects:\nAccustomed soldier\nLars-G\xF6ran
    is decent at everything."
